     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Overview of Automation Modules – webTMS",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The automation modules provide a comprehensive overview of all available functions that can be used for the automation of various tasks and processes. These modules are designed to offer an intuitive user interface that allows operators to navigate the automation process with ease.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/1/csm_software_Automationsmodule_de_3fcc7c439f.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 540
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
