          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2781",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Order Management/Tool Bookings",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Our order management system enables seamless integration of ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions into automation processes. With our system, it is simple to assign individual tools and setup sheets from ZOLLER-TMS directly to the automation pallets. This ensures that the required tools and setup sheets are available for production precisely and on time.</p> <p>To minimize errors, we offer the option to scan DataMatrix codes (DMC) on the stations and tools. Scanning these codes ensures that the correct tools are placed in the correct locations, which improves the accuracy and efficiency of your automation processes. With our solution, you can optimize your production workflows and maximize the reliability of your tool reservations.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/f/csm_software_Auftragsverwaltung_0c24c9c5f2.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
